@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+## Context
+
+`src/index.ts` already parses RFC 6901 pointers (`parsePointer`). Patch needs parent-based mutation.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Deep-clone the document up front (`structuredClone`-style manual clone of JSON) and mutate the clone; clone patch values on insertion so results share nothing with inputs. Any throw discards the clone, giving atomicity.
+- Reuse `parsePointer`; walk tokens to the parent, then apply per container type.
+- Root path `""` handled specially for add/replace/remove/test.
+- Own-property checks and `__proto__` safe handling via `Object.defineProperty`-free approach: use own-key checks and assign through defineProperty for `__proto__` keys.
+- Deep equality implemented locally per JSON semantics.
+- Unknown extra members in operations are ignored, per RFC.
+
+## Risks
+
+Prototype pollution via keys like `__proto__`; mitigated as above.
