+## Why
+
+Services need to update JSON documents with the standard patch format. The library has JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) but no way to apply RFC 6902 JSON Patch.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyPatch(document, patch)` exported from `src/index.ts`, supporting add, remove, replace, move, copy and test.
+- The input document and patch are never mutated; a new document is returned.
+- Invalid patches and failing operations throw an `Error`.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-patch`: applying RFC 6902 JSON Patch documents to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New code in `src/index.ts` reusing the existing pointer parsing; new tests. No dependencies.
